# Data licence

The compiled dataset in this repository (`data/observations/*.jsonl`, `data/status_events.jsonl`,
`data/thesis.jsonl`, `docs/memos/`, and the exported `web/data/*.json`) is a compilation released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: "<site name> (<url>)" plus the observation ids you rely on.

Each observation row also records its upstream source (`source_id`, `url`) and the source's licence and
attribution string in `seed/sources.yaml`. Those upstream terms govern that row's underlying figure or quotation;
the compilation licence does not enlarge them. Quotations in `raw_snippet` are short excerpts kept for
verification. Where a source lists its own attribution text (for example Epoch AI, CC BY), it is reproduced on
every page that uses the data.

